version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/kzoacn/rigorous-cnt"
url: "https://github.com/kzoacn/rigorous-cnt"
abstract: "A SageMath reference implementation of Algorithms 1–6 from arXiv:2512.01588v2, with exact ideal identities, compact S-units, and independently checked GRH-conditional completeness. Full asymptotic bit-complexity bounds and general mixing bounds for default parameters are not established."
keywords:
  - computational number theory
  - SageMath
  - S-units
  - certified computation
